  "corrections": [
    {
      "original": "JavaScript只有六种数据类型",
      "corrected": "现代语言类型是七种原始类型加Object；typeof null的历史行为需单独说明。",
      "lesson": "manual-types",
      "doc": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Data_structures"
    },
    {
      "original": "构造函数中的return总是无效",
      "corrected": "返回对象会替换默认实例，返回原始值通常被忽略。",
      "lesson": "manual-constructor",
      "doc": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/new"
    },
    {
      "original": "浅拷贝只是复制地址",
      "corrected": "赋值共享对象；浅复制创建新的顶层对象，但其中嵌套引用仍共享。",
      "lesson": "manual-copy-depth",
      "doc": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Shallow_copy"
    },
    {
      "original": "JSON往返是通用深拷贝",
      "corrected": "会丢失部分值与类型，循环引用会失败；根据类型选择structuredClone或明确范围的实现。",
      "lesson": "manual-copy-depth",
      "doc": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/structuredClone"
    },
    {
      "original": "SEO三大标签都影响排名",
      "corrected": "title和描述提供页面信息；Google不使用meta keywords作为排名因素，付费广告与自然结果分开。",
      "lesson": "manual-head-meta",
      "doc": "https://developers.google.com/search/docs/crawling-indexing/special-tags"
    },
    {
      "original": "普通函数this永远是谁调用就指向谁",
      "corrected": "应区分裸调用、严格模式、方法调用、new与显式绑定；箭头继承外层this。",
      "lesson": "manual-this-binding",
      "doc": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/this"
    },
    {
      "original": "放大镜使用pageX直接减rect.left",
      "corrected": "rect采用视口坐标，应配clientX/clientY；采用页面坐标时需换算滚动偏移。",
      "lesson": "manual-magnifier",
      "doc": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/getBoundingClientRect"
    },
    {
      "original": "Less、Bootstrap、lodash可以直接照搬",
      "corrected": "课程涉及的能力在此拆为CSS变量、calc、原生栅格、SVG、structuredClone和原生防抖节流。原文件仅作为出处。",
      "lesson": "manual-less-native",
      "doc": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascading_variables/Using_custom_properties"
    },
    {
      "original": "UA检测后强制跳转移动端",
      "corrected": "响应式布局按宽度和能力适配，matchMedia或功能检测比设备品牌字符串更稳妥。",
      "lesson": "manual-bom-url",
      "doc": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/matchMedia"
    },
    {
      "original": "删除焦点轮廓或只依赖hover",
      "corrected": "保留focus-visible与键盘控制，重要信息不应仅在悬停后出现。",
      "lesson": "manual-reset-focus",
      "doc": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Selectors/:focus-visible"
    }
  ],
